# Normalize to LF in the repo and on checkout, so Prettier's endOfLine=lf
# passes identically on dev machines and on Windows CI runners (whose default
# autocrlf=true would otherwise check out CRLF and fail the format gate).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
